Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}


### Check New Dates
GET http://localhost:8080/api/leave-conflicts/check?employeeId=2&startDate=2026-11-10&endDate=2026-11-11
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}


### Get Conflicting Leaves
GET http://localhost:8080/api/leave-conflicts?employeeId=2&startDate=2026-09-20&endDate=2026-09-21
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}


