### TEST - Critical Employee Unavailable

PUT http://localhost:8080/api/workforce/status/2
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "availability": "UNAVAILABLE"
}

### Approve Leave 11
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/leaves/11/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

### Make Critical Employee Unavailable
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/workforce/status/2
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ABSENT",
  "availability": "UNAVAILABLE"
}